28% Rest. Quick, quick, then slow into the shot.
-0:03 [countdown]
36% @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [slow back]
63% Rest. Right foot last. Open on the forehand, closed on the backhand.
-0:03 [countdown]
72% @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [slow back]
---
