## Forehand behind you (3 min)
Forehand behind you, three minutes. In the back right, halfway between the service box and the back
wall. For the first half, set up in an open stance: face the back corner, right foot nearest the
back wall and last to land, left heel up so your hips can turn. Drop the ball a racket's length out
toward the side wall, level with your right heel, so it's deeper than you'd like, and hit it soft
and high straight down the wall, first bounce near the back of the service box. Then step up to the
short line, hit yourself a high, soft straight drive that goes past you, move back with it, and play
it the same way. Score each set of ten.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
8% Open stance, facing the corner. Drop the racket head.
33% Right foot to the back wall. Left heel up.
50% Now from the short line. Let it go past you, then go with it.
75% Count them: straight, and bouncing first behind the short line.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Backhand behind you (3 min)
Backhand behind you, three minutes. In the back left, halfway between the service box and the back
wall. For the first half, set up in a closed stance: back turned toward the front wall, right foot
stepping across toward the back corner and last to land, left heel up so your hips can turn. Drop
the ball a racket's length out toward the side wall, level with your right heel, so it's deeper than
you'd like, and hit it soft and high straight down the wall, first bounce near the back of the
service box. Then step up to the short line, hit yourself a high, soft straight drive that goes past
you, move back with it, and play it the same way. Score each set of ten.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
8% Closed stance, right foot across. Drop the racket head.
33% Back to the front wall. Racket set high.
50% Now from the short line. Let it go past you, then go with it.
75% Count them: straight, and bouncing first behind the short line.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: turn in the corner (3 min)
Ghosting, turn in the corner, three minutes. Medium pace, back corners, every one a ball that has
got past you. Back right, open, facing the corner. Back left, closed, back to the front wall. Swing
straight down the wall on the beep. Then push off your right foot, one step out, and back to the T
for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium back]
26% Rest. Push off your right foot.
-0:03 [countdown]
34% @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium back]
60% Rest. Hips to the front on the way back, chest turned.
-0:03 [countdown]
68% @random{fill, at most 2 in a row} [medium back]
---
[stop]

## Cross-court cut-off (3 min)
Cross-court cut-off, three minutes. Put a spare ball on the floor at the front of each service box,
a metre in from the side wall. They're only markers. Stand by the right one and hit a high, soft
cross-court aimed to bounce by the left one. Move across and volley it before it gets there, then
cross it back toward the right marker and cut that one off too. Slow, high feeds to start. Halfway,
move both markers back to the short line, so you're cutting off deeper balls. A ball you cut off
never gets behind you.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
8% Move as it leaves the front wall.
31% Racket up as you cross. Take it before it passes you.
50% Move the markers back to the short line.
72% Going well? Lower and quicker.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Ghosting: drive and cut off (3 min)
Ghosting, drive and cut off, three minutes. Medium pace, back corners and the middle. A back call is
a drive from the corner. A middle call is the cross-court you hunt, so push forward and across to
volley it. Swing on the beep, and get back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, no repeats} [medium back], [medium middle]
26% Rest. Back: go with the ball. Middle: go forward to it.
-0:03 [countdown]
34% @random{fill, no repeats} [medium back], [medium middle]
60% Rest. Split step on every call.
-0:03 [countdown]
68% @random{fill, no repeats} [medium back], [medium middle]
---
[stop]

## Drives and a cross-court lob (3 min)
Drives and a cross-court lob, three minutes. At the back of the right service box. Three straight
drives, then a high cross-court lob to the back left, three straight backhand drives there, and lob
back. Let each drive get a little past you, so you play it in the stance, facing the corner. The lob
is the way out when the ball has beaten you: get low, open the face, and lift it high to the far
back corner.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
8% One, two, three, lob.
33% Get under the lob. Lift it high.
58% Lob high enough to get back to the T.
78% Straight drives tight to the wall.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]

## Forehand past you when tired (2 min)
Forehand past you when tired, two minutes. From the short line, hit yourself a high, soft straight
drive that goes past you, move back with it, and play it straight and high from the stance. Tired is
when you stop turning and start reaching, so hold the same shot. Score each set of ten: straight,
and bouncing first behind the short line.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
