## Ghosting: deep balls (3 min)
Ghosting, deep balls, three minutes. Fast pace, all six positions, with the back corners called
twice as often. Every back corner in the stance: open on the forehand, closed on the backhand. Split
step on every call, swing on the beep, and sprint back to the T for the next call.
